{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-97","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：截差无理线段与平方与比例","englishTitle":"The square on an apotome applied to a rational straight line produces as breadth a first apotome.","book":10,"number":97,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.97","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.97/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":97,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-97@raw-e2b044c0d9dc2333","contentId":"euclid-10-97","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e2b044c0d9dc23335ad77cd6199ab704b99d3709942d16c5263997a4cc0429d3","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-97.statement","euclid-10-97.construction.1","euclid-10-97.construction.2","euclid-10-97.proof.1","euclid-10-97.proof.2","euclid-10-97.construction.3","euclid-10-97.proof.3","euclid-10-97.proof.4","euclid-10-97.proof.5","euclid-10-97.proof.6","euclid-10-97.proof.7","euclid-10-97.proof.8","euclid-10-97.proof.9","euclid-10-97.proof.10","euclid-10-97.proof.11","euclid-10-97.proof.12","euclid-10-97.proof.13","euclid-10-97.proof.14","euclid-10-97.proof.15","euclid-10-97.proof.16","euclid-10-97.proof.17","euclid-10-97.conclusion","euclid-10-97.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-97.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-97","revisionId":"euclid-10-97@raw-e2b044c0d9dc2333","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"87549302a89234adcb9ab34a7196e29527e5685079da69383aeac0bfcd35ffe6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The square on an apotome applied to a rational straight line produces as breadth a first apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"截差无理线段卫星上的正方形 用于有理线段卫星的 宽度为截差无理线段"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-97.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-97","revisionId":"euclid-10-97@raw-e2b044c0d9dc2333","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5764607a4e15b4838285a90bbffdad5c84bb913f69d5e3283533c7487c8dcc45","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be an apotome, and CD rational, and to CD let there be applied CE equal to the square on AB and producing CF as breadth; I say that CF is a first apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB是截差无理线段,CD 有理,CD,CE等于AB的正方形,宽度扩大CF;我说CF是第一个截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-97.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-97","revisionId":"euclid-10-97@raw-e2b044c0d9dc2333","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4af0009a11df3bf96ef04de615676ba8f593da648f89c78f680372658d43cd32","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let BG be the annex to AB; therefore AG, GB are rational straight lines commensurable in square only. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BG是AB的附件;因此,AG,GB是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-97.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-97","revisionId":"euclid-10-97@raw-e2b044c0d9dc2333","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"41fe7e2e05764a53370389cbec3cc26174276388abc4c2bc6b4c24ed27b16425","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To CD let there be applied CH equal to the square on AG, and KL equal to the square on BG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"CD上可作出CH,AG上可作出正方形,BG上可作出KL。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-97.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-97","revisionId":"euclid-10-97@raw-e2b044c0d9dc2333","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"90da20d4f23767a71885f9d42b482f154434e5dd42033137fd37bcdf309bbfe3","citations":["euclid-2-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the whole CL is equal to the squares on AG, GB, and, in these, CE is equal to the square on AB; therefore the remainder FL is equal to twice the rectangle AG, GB. [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,CL部分等于AG部分的正方形个部分,GB部分等于AB部分的正方形个部分,其余部分等于矩形个部分的2倍,AG部分等于GB部分。（相关点与线段：CE、FL） [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-97.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-97","revisionId":"euclid-10-97@raw-e2b044c0d9dc2333","order":5,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"43c15fb430a4bf2b83e8255524928df5fc48f5f95473cfeb69c425fa0feb566f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let FM be bisected at the point N, and let NO be drawn through N parallel to CD; therefore each of the rectangles FO, LN is equal to the rectangle AG, GB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FM在N点被分成两部分,NO在N之间划线,CD平行;因此,矩形FOLN中,每个等于矩形AGGB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-97.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-97","revisionId":"euclid-10-97@raw-e2b044c0d9dc2333","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0d0ef10c28cbc22cb479c8d7c1183327867a9af141dc0e6b91f7aaadc9a9933c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the squares on AG, GB are rational, and DM is equal to the squares on AG, GB,. therefore DM is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为 AG 与 GB 的平方都是有理面积，而 DM 等于 AG 与 GB 的平方和，所以 DM 也是有理面积。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-97.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-97","revisionId":"euclid-10-97@raw-e2b044c0d9dc2333","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8ce2c65a9f18e225d363de0f168a3fac150657631ab92a7a6a014a8493cd92aa","citations":["euclid-10-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it has been applied to the rational straight line CD, producing CM as breadth; therefore CM is rational and commensurable in length with CD. [[X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其范围已扩大到有理线段 CD,宽度扩大为CM;因此,CM是有理,长度可公度是CD。 [[X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-97.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-97","revisionId":"euclid-10-97@raw-e2b044c0d9dc2333","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cdcdf478f2a6de8abb2a9cfdc57c7287cc87ccf91627fa0220d66fe86a6d95af","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since twice the rectangle AG, GB is medial, and FL is equal to twice the rectangle AG, GB, therefore FL is medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于矩形 AG的两倍,GB是中项无理线段,FL等于矩形 AG的两倍,GB,GB,GB,FL是中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-97.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-97","revisionId":"euclid-10-97@raw-e2b044c0d9dc2333","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2a300f7f909a3e4270925efcd00e7a499274ba4b9d82423cbfa33ac9fac92703","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line CD, producing FM as breadth; therefore FM is rational and incommensurable in length with CD. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其范围扩大到FM宽,因此,FM长为有理,不可公度长为CD。 [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-97.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-97","revisionId":"euclid-10-97@raw-e2b044c0d9dc2333","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"28a65dbf6a8786d16b52126ad21723c67810a06ebbeae2fb1f071a6c270bfc77","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the squares on AG, GB are rational, while twice the rectangle AG, GB is medial, therefore the squares on AG, GB are incommensurable with twice the rectangle AG, GB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AG正方形GB有理矩形AGGB中项无理线段2倍 所以AG正方形GB不可公度2倍"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-97.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-97","revisionId":"euclid-10-97@raw-e2b044c0d9dc2333","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0aace3f9947659126d784534e3aa63ac35eb3d6362b77aa3c59daaece06fc583","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And CL is equal to the squares on AG, GB, and FL to twice the rectangle AG, GB; therefore DM is incommensurable with FL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"CL等于正方形,AG,GB,FL等于矩形,AG,GB的两倍;因此,DM等于不可公度,FL。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-97.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-97","revisionId":"euclid-10-97@raw-e2b044c0d9dc2333","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7fea9662a26a73d4588645e48a147a4bdf7c31569addbe92abf97bcd2b17cdfd","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as DM is to FL, so is CM to FM; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore CM is incommensurable in length with FM. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,DM比FL等于CM比FM,因此,CM比DM等于FM；DM 与 FL 之比等于 CM 与 FM 之比；上述对应量不可公度。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-97.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-97","revisionId":"euclid-10-97@raw-e2b044c0d9dc2333","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e9689d66c63909b8fca33480f6a6e8446452b520ecf2c95b52eb0af220454a2f","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And both are rational; therefore CM, MF are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore CF is an apotome. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两者均为有理;因此,CM,MF是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;因此,CF是截差无理线段。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-97.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-97","revisionId":"euclid-10-97@raw-e2b044c0d9dc2333","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e08e5ab5f57f3b41f98bed505a10b3898beb4764bc27f0dfe0253ee7f93f6dcd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also a first apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,这也是第一个截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-97.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-97","revisionId":"euclid-10-97@raw-e2b044c0d9dc2333","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2706e2c1fd436195114b47481cb619ace89794927285f9fd8c0c9da338675397","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since the rectangle AG, GB is a mean proportional between the squares on AG, GB, and CH is equal to the square on AG, KL equal to the square on BG, and NL equal to the rectangle AG, GB, therefore NL is also a mean proportional between CH, KL; therefore, as CH is to NL, so is NL to KL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为矩形 AG,GB是比例中项,GB,AG等于正方形,AG等于比例中项,KL等于正方形,BG等于,NL等于矩形 AG,GB,NL也是比例中项,CH,KL,NL是比例中项,CH,NL即KL,CH,CH比NL等于NL-KL；CH 与 NL 之比等于 NL 与 KL 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-97.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-97","revisionId":"euclid-10-97@raw-e2b044c0d9dc2333","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"752cfcd33b2b56857ffad421a321b92034e1c7a3ee89fc63f1b8a1a88ebd124f","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-6-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as CH is to NL, so is CK to NM, and, as NL is to KL, so is NM to KM; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore the rectangle CK, KM is equal to the square on NM [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)], that is, to the fourth part of the square on FM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,CH对NL的比等于CK对NM的比,NL对KL的比等于NM对KM的比;因此,矩形对CK、KM的比等于NM对正方形的比,即正方形对FM的比的第四点；CH 与 NL 之比等于 CK 与 NM 之比；NL 与 KL 之比等于 NM 与 KM 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-97.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-97","revisionId":"euclid-10-97@raw-e2b044c0d9dc2333","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f650955acf02602bba088ea7beaedfb81abe30eb91143b909c060597b7add046","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the square on AG is commensurable with the square on GB, CH is also commensurable with KL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AG正方形可公度正方形GBGBGBCH可公度KL"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-97.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-10-97","revisionId":"euclid-10-97@raw-e2b044c0d9dc2333","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ac2873760dc3d0436706ff6c1b13036908a3238a16027c0943796244046ca55f","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as CH is to KL, so is CK to KM; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore CK is commensurable with KM. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,CH对KL的比等于CK对KM的比;因此,CK对KM的比是可公度对KM；CH 与 KL 之比等于 CK 与 KM 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-97.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-10-97","revisionId":"euclid-10-97@raw-e2b044c0d9dc2333","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0d01d84c77a4615c9ef8ade8342e4f12bd99e163a32c5a7bf140af5ebd8e21bc","citations":["euclid-10-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then CM, MF are two unequal straight lines, and to CM there has been applied the rectangle CK, KM equal to the fourth part of the square on FM and deficient by a square figure, while CK is commensurable with KM, therefore the square on CM is greater than the square on MF by the square on a straight line commensurable in length with CM. [[X. 17](/principles/euclid-10-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自那以后,CM,MF是两个不平等的直线,CM被适用矩形,CK,KM等于正方形中的第四部分,但有正方形不足,CK等于可公度,KM等于KM,因此,CM等于正方形,比正方形等于MF,长度可公度等于CM。（相关点与线段：FM） [[X. 17](/principles/euclid-10-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-97.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-10-97","revisionId":"euclid-10-97@raw-e2b044c0d9dc2333","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9abd1e4ab960a39a4b7ae3c5a283a6e47a8aea6680d2135ec2028b2fa086a882","citations":["euclid-10-def-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And CM is commensurable in length with the rational straight line CD set out; therefore CF is a first apotome. [[X. Deff. III. 1](/principles/euclid-10-def-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"CM是长度可公度,有理线段、CD已经确定, 因此CF是第一个截差无理线段。 [[X. Deff. III. 1](/principles/euclid-10-def-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-97.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-97","revisionId":"euclid-10-97@raw-e2b044c0d9dc2333","order":21,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-97.source","contentId":"euclid-10-97","revisionId":"euclid-10-97@raw-e2b044c0d9dc2333","order":22,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"221b3fa82112e5b9efc7641516d9b485a6692a3bb452bdbe58971160689818f4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.97/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-